{"ref":"BDB, גֵּרָא","hw":"גֵּרָא","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֵּרָא</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">גרא</span><strong>)</strong> son of Benjamin <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:21\" href=\"/Genesis.46.21\">Gn 46:21</a> (lacking <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:38-40\" href=\"/Numbers.26.38-40\">Nu 26:38–40</a>); son of Bela<em>ʿ</em>, & grandson of Benj., according to <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.3\">1 Ch 8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.5\">5</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.7\">7</a>; designation of a Benjamite family or clan; hence Ehud called <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־גֵּרָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:15\" href=\"/Judges.3.15\">Ju 3:15</a>, & so Shimei, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.5\">2 S 16:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.17\">19:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.19\">19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.8\">1 K 2:8</a>.","next":"BDB, גרב","prev":"BDB, גִּר²"}